#: ksystraycmd.cpp:60
msgid ""
"No window matching pattern '%1' and no command specified.\n"
msgstr ""
"'%1' ürnägenä kileşkän täräzälär yuq, boyırıq ta bilgelänmäde.\n"

#: ksystraycmd.cpp:67
msgid "KSysTrayCmd: KShellProcess cannot find a shell."
msgstr "KSysTrayCmd: KShellProcess qabıqnı taba almí."

#: ksystraycmd.cpp:234 main.cpp:50
msgid "KSysTrayCmd"
msgstr "KSysTrayCmd"

#: ksystraycmd.cpp:235
msgid "&Hide"
msgstr "&Yäşer"

#: ksystraycmd.cpp:235
msgid "&Restore"
msgstr "&Torğız"

#: ksystraycmd.cpp:236
msgid "&Undock"
msgstr "&Ayır"

#: main.cpp:24
msgid "Command to execute"
msgstr "Eşlätäse boyırıq"

#: main.cpp:26
msgid ""
"A regular expression matching the window title\n"
"If you do not specify one, then the very first window\n"
"to appear will be taken - not recommended."
msgstr ""
"Tärtip çağılışı bu täräzä başlığına kileşte\n"
"Berärse dä bilgelängän bulmasa, kürsätü öçen\n"
"iñ berençe täräzä alınır - kiñäş itelmi."

#: main.cpp:29
msgid ""
"The window id of the target window\n"
"Specifies the id of the window to use. If the id starts with 0x\n"
"it is assumed to be in hex."
msgstr ""
"Maqsat täräzäseneñ tanıtması\n"
"Qullanası täräzä tanıtmasın bilgeli. Ul 0x belän başlansa\n"
"unaltışarlı san qullanılaçaq."

#: main.cpp:32
msgid "Hide the window to the tray on startup"
msgstr "Cibärelgändä täräzäne ulaqqa yäşert"

#: main.cpp:33
msgid ""
"Wait until we are told to show the window before\n"
"executing the command"
msgstr ""
"Boyırıq eşlätkänçe bu täräzäne kürsät dip\n"
"äytelgängä tikle kötäse"

#: main.cpp:35
msgid "Sets the initial tooltip for the tray icon"
msgstr "Ulaq tamğasına baş qoralkiñäş quyu"

#: main.cpp:36
msgid ""
"Keep the tray icon even if the client exits. This option\n"
"has no effect unless startonshow is specified."
msgstr ""
"Klient çıqsa da tamğanı ulaqta qaldırası.\n"
"startonshow köylämäse sünek torğanda bonısı da eşlämi."

#: main.cpp:38
msgid ""
"Don't use window's icon in systray, but ksystraycmd one's\n"
"(should be use with --icon to specify ksystraycmd icon)"
msgstr ""

#: main.cpp:40
msgid "Try to keep the window above other windows"
msgstr ""

#: main.cpp:41
msgid ""
"Quit the client when we are told to hide the window.\n"
"This has no effect unless startonshow is specified and implies keeprunning."
msgstr "Bu täräzäne yäşertergä quşqanda klienttän çığası."

#: main.cpp:52
msgid "Allows any application to be kept in the system tray"
msgstr "Yazılımnarğa sistem ulağında bulırğa birü"

#: main.cpp:92
msgid "No command or window specified"
msgstr "Boyırıq ta, täräzä dä bilgelänmäde"

